\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Three days later, Hayley dropped a stack of medical files on Sarah's desk with a triumphant thud.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Every Elvisette who's been with Tony in the last two months shows the same pattern," she announced. "Elevated white cell count, unprecedented cellular regeneration, and complete resistance to the TMinus-Virus."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Kathy leaned over the files, fascinated. "These numbers are impossible. It's like their immune systems have been supercharged."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"And it's spreading," Hayley added. "Secondary transmission is occurring between Elvisettes and their other partners. It's exponential\'97but still limited to Tony's social circle."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah examined the data, her expression carefully neutral. "We need to scale this. Fast."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"We need to get out of this mountain fortress," Kathy said emphatically. "I'm going stir-crazy up here. Let's take this directly to the High Elvis."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"And Tony," Hayley added reluctantly. "Though I'd prefer not to."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah raised an eyebrow. "Not a fan?"\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Please," Hayley scoffed. "The man practically has 'STD factory' tattooed on his forehead."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Kathy suppressed a smile. "He does have certain... qualities, though. I was thinking\'97"\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Don't even go there," Hayley warned, recognizing the mischievous glint in Kathy's eye. "If you're suggesting what I think you're suggesting\'97"\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"A thruple arrangement could be interesting," Kathy teased. "For science, of course."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"I'd rather drink from the Layer," Hayley retorted, making Sarah laugh despite the gravity of their situation.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Careful," Sarah cautioned, unconsciously touching her growing belly. "Tony isn't just the Great Teacher anymore. He's becoming something else entirely."\
